\newlabel{tab:content-subsets}{{9}{20}{All five content-sensitivity subsets, using unchanged locked predictions. D denotes default versus context; S denotes student state versus model-by-subject. R/E/A denote revelation, elicitation and acknowledgement. Entries are source-equal Brier gains, not new hypothesis tests}{table.caption.36}{}}
